WEBVTT

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:24.840
Saint Seiya

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.150
The Underworld.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:35.250
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:40.160
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.710
They are at the mercy of destiny.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:44.750
Furthermore,

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:50.260
Lord Hades prepared a
despondent fate for Earth.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:55.960
Greatest Eclipse.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:00.210
All creatures of Earth will perish by

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:05.330
an eternal eclipse.

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:08.810
It will turn into a dark, cold world.

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:22.460
Farewell Gold Saints

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.070
Finally, they're all here.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:32.440
All twelve Gold Cloths.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.020
Grand Master? What's going on, Grand Master?

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.560
Why have all the Gold Cloths gathered here?

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.990
Even the ones without their owners
are here in the Underworld.

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:51.430
It's all for Athena, and
to summon sunlight to hell.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.320
What? The Gold Cloths.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.100
They are glowing again!

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.730
The twelve Gold Saints.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:32.930
They have all been revived.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.310
Aioros.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:40.520
Aioria, you have fought valiantly for Athena.

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:43.820
I'm proud of you, brother.

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:47.150
Brother.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:52.860
Master Camus. I'm so happy to see you again.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.750
Me too, Hyoga.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.130
Shura.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:02.010
Is my Excalibur some use to you, Shiryu?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.570
Yes, of course.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.180
Aldebaran.

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.390
It's been a while, Seiya.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.230
Deathmask, Aphrodite.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:15.320
Even you two.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:18.650
You guys.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:22.120
Even in death, after your
bodies have perished,

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.150
your souls still serve Athena.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:29.970
Will you fight for love and peace on Earth?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.830
Grand Master, let us
forge the way to Elysion.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:43.800
I see. You were all revived for that purpose.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.540
Aioros has pulled back his arrow.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.810
Mu, Miro, Shaka.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:03.710
Yes.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.140
We know.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.040
Let's go.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:09.460
Aioria!

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:12.500
Farewell, Seiya.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.420
Farewell?

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.340
What do Aioria and the others intend to do?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:26.450
Seiya, Shiryu, Hyoga, Shun, leave this place.

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.770
What do you mean, Grand Master?

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:35.290
The twelve Gold Saints will transfer all
their Cosmo into the arrow of Aioros.

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:37.150
The arrow of Aioros?

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.340
All of the Gold Saints...

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:40.690
Cosmo?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:48.080
Right. This is the first and last time
all Gold Saints will release the arrow.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:55.040
Although small, it will create sunlight
and destroy the Wailing Wall.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:06:01.610
However, when it happens,
we will no longer be here.

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:02.880
Grand Master.

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:07.630
The impact of the attack
will be that powerful.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:11.140
Now, get out of here.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:12.760
But...

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:19.270
Don't forget you have the duty to
deliver the Athena Cloth to Athena.

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:21.730
Grand Master.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:28.560
Listen, only Gods can go
past the Wailing Wall.

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:33.490
If a mortal tries to pass
through into Elysion,

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:38.030
he will be blown back or
transported to another dimension.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.970
But that may not happen to you.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:49.330
You are bearing the Cloths that have been
touched by the blood of a God, Athena.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:53.810
Your bodies have been blessed
by the blood of a God.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.040
Athena's blood?

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.770
In our Cloths?

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:03.960
Listen, you must travel the path to
Elysion on which only gods are permitted.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:08.880
To end the battle with Hades that

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:12.780
has been going on since ancient times.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.220
To put the battle with Hades...

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:16.590
To an end.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:17.980
That's right.

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:20.590
We found out in the last holy war

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:26.290
that Hades keeps his real body in Elysion.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.630
Huh? What did you say?

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:37.090
Hades, born between Cronus and
Rhea, adores his beautiful body.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:44.970
When the world comes under his control,
he plans to rule it in his own body.

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:55.210
He's afraid of damaging his own body.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.080
And so he chose a different body
to resurrect into each time.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:04.050
Just as he chose your body this time, Shun.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:06.670
So that means...

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.070
That's right.

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:15.020
You must go to Elysion to find and
destroy the resting body of Hades.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:20.450
If you do so, Hades will give up
his plans for world domination.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.240
The battle will forever be over.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.270
Destroy the real body...

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:27.390
Of Hades in Elysion.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:31.980
That is something only you can do.

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:36.490
Now that you understand, leave this place.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:37.410
Grand Master.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.380
I'm counting on you, Seiya.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.310
Aioria.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.540
Go to Elysion, Hyoga.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.230
Miro.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.750
And protect Athena.

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.930
Protect peace on Earth.

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.740
Shaka, Mu.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:04.350
Now go, young Saints of hope!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.850
We entrust Athena to you.

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.330
Let's go, you guys!

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:23.290
We will go.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.660
To Elysion with the Cloths that have
been blessed with Athena's blood.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:32.220
We will deliver the Athena
Cloth to Miss Saori.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:37.040
And we will defeat Hades. For certain!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.800
At that moment, it felt as though

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.690
the twelve Gold Saints were smiling upon us.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.770
As if they were our older brothers.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:10:00.160
That's right. We are brothers
in arms since ancient times.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.760
To those brothers,

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.380
the time had come to bid farewell.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:09.180
Farewell, honorable Saints.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.790
Farewell, Gold Saints!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.870
The Gold Cloths have gathered in Giudecca.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:23.340
The Bronze Saints are moving
away from the Wailing Wall.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:38.750
Are they really trying to
destroy the Wailing Wall?

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.390
Grand Master.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:50.530
Shiryu, my clumsy pupil,
tough battles await you.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:53.270
You must not die.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.510
I will be waiting at the Five Ancient Peaks.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.200
For Shunrei.

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:06.180
You must not die, Shiryu.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:10.830
Shura.

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:14.900
Shiryu, I need to thank you.

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:17.660
Ultimate Dragon Punch!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.750
Impossible.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:23.540
Do you want to win that much?
What is victory if you die?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:27.630
Why do you take it so far? Why?

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:31.600
Shura, you should know if you're a Saint.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.840
It's for Athena.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:40.100
You've awakened me to the truth,
and it's burned into my Cosmo.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.890
My master, Camus.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.670
Hyoga.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:54.940
Don't look back, Hyoga.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:59.690
When a man makes a decision, he
needs to see it through to the end.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:04.600
Don't get heated. Keep cool, Hyoga.

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.590
Aphrodite.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.210
Shun.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.050
Stop it!

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:24.380
Die, Andromeda. Take the Bloody Rose!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.030
Nebula Storm!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:47.830
Go create a miracle like
you did back then, Shun.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.460
You!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.020
Minos.

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:02.340
Minos?

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.470
One of the Underworld's Big Three.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:08.830
What do you plan to do to the
Wailing Wall? Move aside!

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:11.330
We won't move!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.650
We won't let you get past us!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.110
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.410
Fool.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:22.160
What?

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:26.110
Fool. Cosmic Marionation!

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.740
My Meteor Punch.

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:36.290
Nebula Chain!

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:51.180
My chain was blocked so easily.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.470
We won't let you...

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:54.900
Interrupt the Gold Saints.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:57.360
Diamond Dust!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:59.270
Dragon Flight Punch!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.630
Cosmic Marionation!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:19.490
Fools! Bronze Saints can't stop
one of the Underworld's Big Three.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:24.090
Now, all four of you will
feel my Cosmic Marionation!

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:29.050
Cosmic Mario...

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:39.570
Let's say it now, all of us.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.360
Young Bronze Saints.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.890
For love.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:47.180
And peace on Earth.

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:48.280
We will go.

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.700
With our lives and soul!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.200
Burn now, golden Cosmo!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:15:00.670
Athena, show us a ray of light
in this world of darkness!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.000
...Marionation!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.710
The Wailing Wall.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.470
The Gold Saints.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.090
Did they do it?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.230
Could the Wailing Wall fall?

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:07.200
If so,

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:11.600
my wish may come true.

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:17.190
Are you guys all right?

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.900
That was an incredible explosion.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.780
What about the Gold Saints?

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:27.550
Everyone, let's go!

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:52.520
Look.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.000
The Wailing Wall.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:55.280
Seiya.

00:16:55.870 --> 00:17:00.570
They did it! There's an
opening in the Wailing Wall!

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:02.490
Unbelievable.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:04.330
What tremendous power.

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:08.050
Though not Gods, they did it
with their own mortal power.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:11.760
What about the Gold Saints?

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.330
Where are the Gold Saints?

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:15.850
What's that?

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.060
Grand Master.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.110
My master, Camus!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.760
The Gold Saints.

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:25.970
They have all passed on.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:32.940
Yes, they have. Entrusting us with
love, peace and everything else.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.170
Grand Master, Shura.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.950
My master, Camus.

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:41.840
Shaka, Mu, Aphrodite, Miro.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:45.050
Aioros, Aioria, Deathmask.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.480
Saga, and Aldebaran!

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:56.120
Well, well. You're the first one
who's broken the horn of Taurus.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:03.090
You raised your Cosmo to the level
of a Gold Saint, even for an instant.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:06.270
You truly are real Saints.

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:13.210
I want to see how far you guys will go.

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.580
And where this battles goes.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:20.320
Perfect, Hyoga.

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:26.050
To make the Aurora Execution
your own attack in this battle.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.590
Master Camus,

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:35.980
I pledge to follow your teaching
and continue to fight.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:43.320
Yes, Shiryu. My soul lives
on in your left arm.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.370
My Excalibur.

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:53.420
Dohko, you bear the Libra
Cloth after 243 years.

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:57.790
Grand Master, Shura.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:04.820
I will never forget. I am forever
in debt to you two. Thank you.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:17.890
Somehow... Somehow please rest in peace.

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:18.960
No.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:25.370
It's not the time to be crying.

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:31.440
There is something we must do.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:32.440
Seiya.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.320
Seiya.

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.230
Seiya.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:41.070
Let's go. The Gold Saints
have opened up the way.

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:43.200
We can't let it go to waste.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:47.350
We look for Athena and find where
the real body of Hades lies,

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:48.540
in Elysion!

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:56.020
Thanks to the sacrifice of the Gold Saints,

00:19:56.020 --> 00:20:00.250
the Wailing Wall has been destroyed
and the path to Elysion cleared.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.050
However,

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:06.690
the young Saints of hope have
not finished the battle yet.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:17.480
Hades initiated the Greatest Eclipse

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:21.980
to plunge the world into darkness.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:27.750
Primary school of the stars

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:35.550
All living creatures will perish.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:41.600
The moment the world becomes a
dark, cold place is drawing near.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:31.600
Is that...

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:20.240
The young warriors are unaware that
the goddess Athena is in danger.

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:22.580
Wait for us.

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:23.810
Miss Saori.

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:28.160
Miss Saori!
